# Lock files Excel and Word leave behind while a document is open. Transient,
# never worth committing, and they only appear while someone has the file open.
~$*
.~lock.*#

# Scratch files psql writes when a verification script redirects its echo output
# so the real check results stay readable. Harmless, regenerated on every run.
align_dates_output.txt
trigger_output.txt
set_approval_output.txt
attr_fix_output.txt
dup_guard_output.txt
fix_quiet_output.txt
